    <!-- Changelog -->
    <string name="changelog_title">What\'s new</string>
    <string name="changelog_current_badge">Current</string>

    <string-array name="changelog_1_3_0">
        <item>The app icon is a clock now, reading five past five: five o’clock is the 25 minutes of a pomodoro and one o’clock the 5 of a short break. The tomato was a red circle that said nothing about what the app does.</item>
        <item>The end-of-slot sound can repeat up to ten times in a row, with a separate setting for the pomodoro and for the break. One chime is easy to miss from the kitchen.</item>
        <item>«Pause», «Reset» and «Skip» sit centred in the space below the tomato instead of crammed against it.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="changelog_1_2_0">
        <item>The screen stays awake while the phone is charging, so you can watch the countdown without touching anything. You can set it to never or always in Settings.</item>
        <item>The timer now fits with the phone on its side: «Skip» used to end up off the bottom of the screen in landscape.</item>
        <item>«Reset» and «Skip» are white now. In grey they looked disabled.</item>
        <item>A new Settings entry to email the author.</item>
        <item>The app icon no longer sits inside a black circle on light wallpapers.</item>
        <item>The home screen widget no longer sits on a black plate: you see just the tomato. The plate is still there in Settings.</item>
        <item>The timer tomato loses the leaves it grew during breaks.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="changelog_1_1_0">
        <item>The end of a pomodoro and the end of a break now sound different, and each one can be changed on its own. By default, a singing bowl when you finish working and a bell when the break is over: one is a reward, the other is an order.</item>
        <item>The sound picker plays each option as you tap it and stays open so you can compare them. Before, it changed the sound and closed without letting you hear anything.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="changelog_1_0_1">
        <item>The widget no longer has a grey outline around it.</item>
        <item>The monthly map no longer overlaps the legend below it on wide screens and tablets.</item>
        <item>The status bar is readable again when your phone is set to the light theme: the clock and the battery were being drawn dark over the app\'s black background.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="changelog_1_0_0">
        <item>First release.</item>
        <item>Pomodoro timer with focus, short break and long break every N Pomodoros. Every duration is configurable.</item>
        <item>One-cell home screen widget: tap to start or pause, double-tap to reset. It shows what the tap will do.</item>
        <item>Timer notification with the time left in large type and pause, reset and skip in reach without expanding it.</item>
        <item>End-of-interval alert with a sound of your choice and vibration for as long as you want. It reaches a paired watch with two actions: start the next one, or dismiss.</item>
        <item>Statistics: completed Pomodoros, time focused, day streak, monthly map and 30-day trend.</item>
        <item>Auto-start each way separately: let the break roll on without the next Pomodoro doing the same.</item>
        <item>Spanish and English. Dark theme only. No ads, no tracking, no accounts.</item>
    </string-array>
